('architecture-empire-state','Architecture','How long did it take to build the Empire State Building?','From the start of construction to opening day.',35424000000,35424000000,35424000000,'1 year, 45 days','Construction rose at an average rate of more than four and a half floors each week.','Wikipedia — Empire State Building','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Empire_State_Building','2026-09-18',1,'active')
