('space-voyager-jupiter','Space','How long did Voyager 1 take to reach Jupiter?','From launch to closest approach.',47174400000,47174400000,47174400000,'546 days','Voyager 1 launched in 1977 and is now the most distant human-made object.','Wikipedia — Voyager 1','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Voyager_1','2026-09-18',2,'active')
